# Outfit body: long trench coat with an accent belt and collar (R23). V5.5: shaped, not a slab: an octagonal torso
# around the mannequin (wide enough to stay outside the body), a belt, a flared skirt split at the front, and a
# turned-up collar. Hollow.
name outfit_trench
grid 2
size 22 26 34
slot coat SwatchMain
slot belt SwatchAccent
# Torso: chamfered octagon around the chest.
poly 16 31 coat 1,5 4,2 18,2 21,5 21,21 18,24 4,24 1,21
# Skirt: wider at the hem, stepped out one voxel per band (a voxel flare).
poly 0 7 coat 0,3 3,0 19,0 22,3 22,23 19,26 3,26 0,23
poly 7 14 coat 1,4 4,1 18,1 21,4 21,22 18,25 4,25 1,22
# Belt between them, one voxel proud.
poly 14 16 belt 0,4 4,0 18,0 22,4 22,22 18,26 4,26 0,22
# Collar: a turned-up ring above the shoulders.
poly 31 34 coat 3,6 6,3 16,3 19,6 19,20 16,23 6,23 3,20
# Hollow it: the mannequin stands inside.
carve poly 0 14 3,6 6,3 16,3 19,6 19,20 16,23 6,23 3,20
carve poly 14 31 3,7 6,4 16,4 19,7 19,19 16,22 6,22 3,19
carve poly 31 34 5,8 8,5 14,5 17,8 17,18 14,21 8,21 5,18
# Open front below the belt, and a V at the neck.
carve box 18 11 0 22 15 13
carve box 17 10 29 22 16 34
# Belt buckle.
box 21 11 14 22 15 16 belt
pivot 11 13 8
